AudD  ·  profile default
                 │ Settings  profile default
 1 Recognize     │ 
 2 Now playing   │ › token                        0123…cdef  (audd config set token)
 3 Streams       │     API token, kept in the system credential store
 4 History       │   format                       auto  (default)
 5 Account       │     default output format: table, json, jsonl, csv (auto: table on a terminal, JSON when piped)
*6 Settings      │   max_requests                 no limit  (default)
 7 Help          │     default --max-requests for every command
                 │   concurrency                  4  (default)
                 │     parallel requests for batch recognition
                 │   streams.background_recorder  true  (default)
                 │     start the background stream recorder automatically
                 │ 
                 │ Settings apply to profile default and are saved in config-dir/config.toml. Environment variables
                 │ (env) win over the file.
